Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:06.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,For {\c&H003CC9FF&}everyone.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:07.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,All at once.
