Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:20.65,Cap,,0,0,160,,{\an8}{\c&H003CC9FF&}Strangers.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,So people {\c&H003CC9FF&}stop{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.77,0:00:23.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:24.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,Even when they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.53,0:00:25.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,need it {\c&H003CC9FF&}most.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:26.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,No one looks
