Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:28.18,Cap,,0,0,160,,{\an8}{\c&H003CC9FF&}symptom.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:29.03,Cap,,0,0,160,,{\an8}No one asks
